n py-3.5"><span class="type-fs-paragraph-medium"><span style="--f_t_color:var(--slate-color-text-primary, #333333);--f_t_decorationColor:var(--slate-color-border-subdued, #6c6a6a)" class="f_t_base f_t_color f_t_paragraphSansMedium">Product description</span></span></div><div id="_R_2qrclfiv5v6bt5tsnpfhbarivb_" class="overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-in-out" style="max-height:0"><div class="space-y-3"><p class="f_t_base f_t_color whitespace-pre-wrap f_t_paragraphSansRegular" style="--f_t_color:var(--slate-color-text-primary, #333333);--f_t_decorationColor:var(--slate-color-border-subdued, #6c6a6a)">Your shortcut to radiant, lifted skin from face to neck. The Berry Bounce Face &amp; Neck Lift Collagen Mask Set is drenched in a potent blend of plant based collagen, hyaluronic acid, and TCM botanical-powered hydration, featuring tremella mushroom, chrysanthemum and goji berry. This intensive treatment deeply hydrates, plumps, and visibly firms while supporting the skin barrier for a smoother, more even-toned glow.

Designed to address two of the most delicate areas, each mask conforms comfortably to the skin, delivering targeted, plant-based collagen care where you need it most. Use it as a quick daytime boost or as an overnight renewal ritual. Wake up (or walk out) looking lifted, luminous, and refreshed.</p></div></div></section><section data-test-id="category-information-section" class="border-fs-border-muted border-t"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_4qrclfiv5v6bt5tsnpfhbarivb_" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between py-3.5 text-left"><span class="type-fs-paragraph-medium"><span style="--f_t_color:var(--slate-color-text-primary, #333333);--f_t_decorationColor:var(--slate-color-border-subdued, #6c6a6a)" class="f_t_base f_t_color f_t_paragraphSansMedium">Dimensions and weight</span></span><span class="group-hover:bg-fs-surface-secondary mr-3 inline-flex shrink-0 rounded p-2 transition-colors duration-200"><span class="inline-flex origin-center transition-transform duration-200 scale-y-100"><svg class="svgicon fs-icon svgicon-font-size" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" style="--f-svg-color:var(--slate-color-icon-primary, #333333);--f-svg-fill:none;--f-svg-font-size:12px" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="m3 9 8.51 8.79A.7.7 0 0 0 12 18a.67.67 0 0 0 .49-.21L21 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></span></button><div id="_R_4qrclfiv5v6bt5tsnpfhbarivb_" inert="" class="overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-in-out cursor-pointer" style="max-height:0"><div class="space-y-3"><p class="f_t_base f_t_color whitespace-pre-wrap f_t_paragraphSansRegular" style="--f_t_color:var(--slate-color-text-primary, #333333);--f_t_decorationColor:var(--slate-color-border-subdued, #6c6a6a)"><span style="--f_t_color:var(--slate-color-text-primary, #333333);--f_t_decorationColor:var(--slate-color-border-subdued, #6c6a6a)" class="f_t_base f_t_color